            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "Passive: gun cooldown doubled. Immune to time stop like the Clockmaker.",
                "zh_cn": "白金之星 世界：时停5s，冷却240s。当你在时停时击杀他人后，你也会进入时停状态。",
                "zh_tw": "白金之星 世界：時停5s，冷卻240s。當你在時停時擊殺他人後，你也會進入時停狀態。"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "ORA Punch: right-click a train door to open it (including iron doors). Right-click to enter an attack: the first target hit is bound to you; this state doesn't end unless you or the target dies. The target cannot move or use items and is fixed in front of you. During this, right-click the target 20 times within 6 seconds to kill them; each hit makes them flinch and swing both arms alternately. On timeout, the attack cancels and items enter half cooldown. While holding, your arm is wrapped in a golden gradient.",
                "zh_cn": "被动：枪的冷却增加一倍。像钟表匠一样免疫时停。",
                "zh_tw": "被動：槍的冷卻增加一倍。像鐘錶匠一樣免疫時停。"
